Pi forwards the consumer's Yield to the caller
open import Pi; handle <Yield(Int)> (catch(fun(){pipe(fun(){yield(20);abort()},fun(){var x=await();yield(x+1);x+2})})) {case x->x case <Yield(x)=>k> -> k(())+x}
stdout : 43 : Int
args : --fresco --path=examples/handlers:examples:lib/stdlib
